# W31c, b (k10): joins a in stag0201, sees the notice of a's entry and does not answer; the offer closes when a leaves.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@800
log b sees the notice
idle until offers=0 fail frames>=3000
log the offer closed
goalong until frames>=120 fail go=asked
log b's late A went nowhere
